        "type": "markdown",
        "value": "<figure class=\"fig\">\n<span class=\"fig-title\">Figure 1 &#183; One model, cut to six sizes from one 38 KB file &#183; all-MiniLM-L6-v2</span>\n<div class=\"fig-key\"><span><i class=\"fig-m fig-m--pi\"></i>elastify (optimised ranking)</span><span><i class=\"fig-m fig-m--cx\"></i>Fisher scores (no optimisation)</span><span><i class=\"fig-m fig-m--cc\"></i>dense model</span></div>\n<div class=\"fig-panel\">\n<span class=\"fig-sub\">Search quality, SciFact nDCG@10</span>\n<div class=\"fig-row\"><span class=\"fig-name\">10% removed</span><span class=\"fig-track\"><i class=\"fig-span\" style=\"left:84.31%;width:2.93%\"></i><i class=\"fig-pt fig-pt--cc\" style=\"left:87.80%\" title=\"Dense model: 64.5\"></i><i class=\"fig-pt fig-pt--cx\" style=\"left:84.31%\" title=\"Fisher scores at 10%: 62.9\"></i><i class=\"fig-pt fig-pt--pi\" style=\"left:87.24%\" title=\"elastify at 10%: 64.3\"></i></span><span class=\"fig-val\">+1.3</span></div>\n<div class=\"fig-row\"><span class=\"fig-name\">20% removed</span><span class=\"fig-track\"><i class=\"fig-span\" style=\"left:71.49%;width:14.62%\"></i><i class=\"fig-pt fig-pt--cc\" style=\"left:87.80%\" title=\"Dense model: 64.5\"></i><i class=\"fig-pt fig-pt--cx\" style=\"left:71.49%\" title=\"Fisher scores at 20%: 57.2\"></i><i class=\"fig-pt fig-pt--pi\" style=\"left:86.11%\" title=\"elastify at 20%: 63.8\"></i></span><span class=\"fig-val\">+6.6</span></div>\n<div class=\"fig-row\"><span class=\"fig-name\">30% removed</span><span class=\"fig-track\"><i class=\"fig-span\" style=\"left:51.84%;width:30.69%\"></i><i class=\"fig-pt fig-pt--cc\" style=\"left:87.80%\" title=\"Dense model: 64.5\"></i><i class=\"fig-pt fig-pt--cx\" style=\"left:51.84%\" title=\"Fisher scores at 30%: 48.3\"></i><i class=\"fig-pt fig-pt--pi\" style=\"left:82.53%\" title=\"elastify at 30%: 62.1\"></i></span><span class=\"fig-val\">+13.8</span></div>\n<div class=\"fig-row\"><span class=\"fig-name\">40% removed</span><span class=\"fig-track\"><i class=\"fig-span\" style=\"left:33.82%;width:37.78%\"></i><i class=\"fig-pt fig-pt--cc\" style=\"left:87.80%\" title=\"Dense model: 64.5\"></i><i class=\"fig-pt fig-pt--cx\" style=\"left:33.82%\" title=\"Fisher scores at 40%: 40.2\"></i><i class=\"fig-pt fig-pt--pi\" style=\"left:71.60%\" title=\"elastify at 40%: 57.2\"></i></span><span class=\"fig-val\">+17.0</span></div>\n<div class=\"fig-row\"><span class=\"fig-name\">50% removed</span><span class=\"fig-track\"><i class=\"fig-span\" style=\"left:31.07%;width:38.18%\"></i><i class=\"fig-pt fig-pt--cc\" style=\"left:87.80%\" title=\"Dense model: 64.5\"></i><i class=\"fig-pt fig-pt--cx\" style=\"left:31.07%\" title=\"Fisher scores at 50%: 39.0\"></i><i class=\"fig-pt fig-pt--pi\" style=\"left:69.24%\" title=\"elastify at 50%: 56.2\"></i></span><span class=\"fig-val\">+17.2</span></div>\n<div class=\"fig-row\"><span class=\"fig-name\">60% removed</span><span class=\"fig-track\"><i class=\"fig-span\" style=\"left:10.04%;width:45.33%\"></i><i class=\"fig-pt fig-pt--cc\" style=\"left:87.80%\" title=\"Dense model: 64.5\"></i><i class=\"fig-pt fig-pt--cx\" style=\"left:10.04%\" title=\"Fisher scores at 60%: 29.5\"></i><i class=\"fig-pt fig-pt--pi\" style=\"left:55.38%\" title=\"elastify at 60%: 49.9\"></i></span><span class=\"fig-val\">+20.4</span></div>\n<div class=\"fig-row fig-row--scale\"><span></span><span class=\"fig-track\"><i class=\"fig-tick\" style=\"left:11.11%\"></i><i class=\"fig-tlab\" style=\"left:11.11%\">30</i><i class=\"fig-tick\" style=\"left:33.33%\"></i><i class=\"fig-tlab\" style=\"left:33.33%\">40</i><i class=\"fig-tick\" style=\"left:55.56%\"></i><i class=\"fig-tlab\" style=\"left:55.56%\">50</i><i class=\"fig-tick\" style=\"left:77.78%\"></i><i class=\"fig-tlab\" style=\"left:77.78%\">60</i><i class=\"fig-tick\" style=\"left:100.00%\"></i><i class=\"fig-tlab\" style=\"left:100.00%\">70</i></span><span class=\"fig-val\">elastify gain</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"fig-panel\">\n<span class=\"fig-sub\">Sentence similarity, STS-B Spearman</span>\n<div class=\"fig-row\"><span class=\"fig-name\">10% removed</span><span class=\"fig-track\"><i class=\"fig-span\" style=\"left:79.36%;width:6.07%\"></i><i class=\"fig-pt fig-pt--cc\" style=\"left:85.93%\" title=\"Dense model: 82.0\"></i><i class=\"fig-pt fig-pt--cx\" style=\"left:79.36%\" title=\"Fisher scores at 10%: 81.1\"></i><i class=\"fig-pt fig-pt--pi\" style=\"left:85.43%\" title=\"elastify at 10%: 82.0\"></i></span><span class=\"fig-val\">+0.8</span></div>\n<div class=\"fig-row\"><span class=\"fig-name\">20% removed</span><span class=\"fig-track\"><i class=\"fig-span\" style=\"left:61.79%;width:16.14%\"></i><i class=\"fig-pt fig-pt--cc\" style=\"left:85.93%\" title=\"Dense model: 82.0\"></i><i class=\"fig-pt fig-pt--cx\" style=\"left:61.79%\" title=\"Fisher scores at 20%: 78.7\"></i><i class=\"fig-pt fig-pt--pi\" style=\"left:77.93%\" title=\"elastify at 20%: 80.9\"></i></span><span class=\"fig-val\">+2.3</span></div>\n<div class=\"fig-row\"><span class=\"fig-name\">30% removed</span><span class=\"fig-track\"><i class=\"fig-span\" style=\"left:40.57%;width:30.14%\"></i><i class=\"fig-pt fig-pt--cc\" style=\"left:85.93%\" title=\"Dense model: 82.0\"></i><i class=\"fig-pt fig-pt--cx\" style=\"left:40.57%\" title=\"Fisher scores at 30%: 75.7\"></i><i class=\"fig-pt fig-pt--pi\" style=\"left:70.71%\" title=\"elastify at 30%: 79.9\"></i></span><span class=\"fig-val\">+4.2</span></div>\n<div class=\"fig-row\"><span class=\"fig-name\">40% removed</span><span class=\"fig-track\"><i class=\"fig-span\" style=\"left:24.64%;width:34.07%\"></i><i class=\"fig-pt fig-pt--cc\" style=\"left:85.93%\" title=\"Dense model: 82.0\"></i><i class=\"fig-pt fig-pt--cx\" style=\"left:24.64%\" title=\"Fisher scores at 40%: 73.5\"></i><i class=\"fig-pt fig-pt--pi\" style=\"left:58.71%\" title=\"elastify at 40%: 78.2\"></i></span><span class=\"fig-val\">+4.8</span></div>\n<div class=\"fig-row\"><span class=\"fig-name\">50% removed</span><span class=\"fig-track\"><i class=\"fig-span\" style=\"left:34.29%;width:21.21%\"></i><i class=\"fig-pt fig-pt--cc\" style=\"left:85.93%\" title=\"Dense model: 82.0\"></i><i class=\"fig-pt fig-pt--cx\" style=\"left:34.29%\" title=\"Fisher scores at 50%: 74.8\"></i><i class=\"fig-pt fig-pt--pi\" style=\"left:55.50%\" title=\"elastify at 50%: 77.8\"></i></span><span class=\"fig-val\">+3.0</span></div>\n<div class=\"fig-row\"><span class=\"fig-name\">60% removed</span><span class=\"fig-track\"><i class=\"fig-span\" style=\"left:15.14%;width:31.57%\"></i><i class=\"fig-pt fig-pt--cc\" style=\"left:85.93%\" title=\"Dense model: 82.0\"></i><i class=\"fig-pt fig-pt--cx\" style=\"left:15.14%\" title=\"Fisher scores at 60%: 72.1\"></i><i class=\"fig-pt fig-pt--pi\" style=\"left:46.71%\" title=\"elastify at 60%: 76.5\"></i></span><span class=\"fig-val\">+4.4</span></div>\n<div class=\"fig-row fig-row--scale\"><span></span><span class=\"fig-track\"><i class=\"fig-tick\" style=\"left:0.00%\"></i><i class=\"fig-tlab\" style=\"left:0.00%\">70</i><i class=\"fig-tick\" style=\"left:28.57%\"></i><i class=\"fig-tlab\" style=\"left:28.57%\">74</i><i class=\"fig-tick\" style=\"left:57.14%\"></i><i class=\"fig-tlab\" style=\"left:57.14%\">78</i><i class=\"fig-tick\" style=\"left:85.71%\"></i><i class=\"fig-tlab\" style=\"left:85.71%\">82</i></span><span class=\"fig-val\">elastify gain</span></div>\n</div>\n<figcaption>Every row is the same dense model cut at runtime with the same ranking, learned in 3 minutes on a laptop RTX 5060 from 1,024 unlabelled wikitext paragraphs. For search, the corpus is indexed once by the dense model and only queries go through the cut one — the paper's elastic deployment setting.</figcaption>\n</figure>"
